alafil 5 mg, were also reviewed. The patient has no complaints and continues to do well. The physical exam was normal, with no acute distress noted.\n\n**April 07, 2023**\n\nMr. Harrington was seen for a follow-up regarding his inguinal hernia status post-repair. His blood pressure was 117/83, and he weighed 153 pounds. We also reviewed his erectile dysfunction, managed with sildenafil 100 mg and tadalafil 5 mg. He has been compliant with his medication regimen, and there have been no complications. The patient also reported occasional urinary tract infections, the latest of which was treated with sulfame"
